OL,5,G0410 Agony
OL,6,     FJane is in despair about her
OL,7,     Fmarriage to Laurence and refuses
OL,8,     Fto see him or allow him into their
OL,9,     Fflat. Laurence bribes Bea into
OL,10,     Finviting him to Jane's forthcoming
OL,11,     FNew Year's Eve party.
OL,12,G0440 Stereo Underground
OL,13,     FRichard Latto presents alternative
OL,14,     Fanthems from a music community
OL,15,     Fwith attitude.
OL,16,G0535 Jack Hargreaves' Old Country
OL,17,     FJack Hargreaves watches several
OL,18,     Fdifferent versions of village
OL,19,     Fskittles being played, and
OL,20,     Fexplains how this ancient game of
OL,21,     FNine Pins became Ten Pin Bowling.
